  "description": "Shared build-quality configuration for Alvecta repositories: the analyzer packages (Roslynator, SonarAnalyzer, Microsoft.VisualStudio.Threading.Analyzers, ReferenceTrimmer, Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.BannedApiAnalyzers, Meziantou.Analyzer), the layered BannedApiAnalyzers symbol lists, the CodeStyle / FrameworkAnalyzers / Meziantou globalconfigs, C# 15 as the default LangVersion with the PolySharp polyfill generator (union types on net10.0), and a minimum .NET SDK of 11.0.100. Reference this package to inherit the standard analyzer + banned-symbol setup with no copy-pasted Directory.Build.props.",
